<title>UK: Dated Brent valued lower in Sept -25 cent trade.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent valued lower in Sept -25 cent trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dated Brent values slipped again on Thursday in a Sept 12-14 trade at Sept paper -25 cents.</p>
<p>On Wednesday a Brent cargo sold at Sept -20 cents after apparently hitting bottom on Monday in a sale at Sept -25.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 17 542 8060</p>
